# Follow-up "spell that" for the last word of the day spoken (today's word
# or a recalled past word). Every line here is a phrasing this skill should
# accept -- the spell_wod.voc phrasings carried over verbatim, plus natural
# variants. This template has no meaning on its own: it only fires when the
# "prev_wod_word" session context is active (requires_context on the
# handler), never on the bare utterance with nothing looked up first.
letreiatu hori [hitza]
nola letreiatzen da (hori|hura)
letreiatu [niretzat]
nola letreiatzen duzu
letreiatu ozen
letreiatu niretzat
letreiatu al dezakezu hori
letreiatu al dezakezu niretzat
